00:19:49,318 --> 00:19:55,079
thing that they laughed more than ever, because they had got into the humor to laugh at

216
00:19:55,079 --> 00:20:04,439
anything. And in the midst of the fun the door opened and in walked Dr. Craven and Mrs.

