00:20:04,439 --> 00:20:11,158
Medlock. Dr. Craven started in actual alarm and Mrs. Medlock almost fell back

218
00:20:11,158 --> 00:20:14,279
because he had accidentally bumped against her.

219
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:22,719
"Good Lord!" exclaimed poor Mrs. Medlock, with her eyes almost starting out of her head. "Good

220
00:20:22,719 --> 00:20:29,199
Lord!" "What is this?" said Dr. Craven, coming forward. "What does it

221
00:20:29,199 --> 00:20:36,799
mean?" Then Mary was reminded of the boy Raja again. Colin answered as if neither the

222
00:20:36,799 --> 00:20:40,879
doctor's alarm nor Mrs. Medlock's terror were of the slightest

