00:21:37,879 --> 00:21:43,959
excitement. Excitement is not good for you, my boy," he said. "I should be excited

235
00:21:43,959 --> 00:21:49,359
if she kept away," answered Colin, his eyes beginning to look dangerously

236
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:55,600
sparkling. "I am better. She makes me better. The nurse must bring up her tea

237
00:21:55,600 --> 00:22:01,079
with mine. We will have tea together." Mrs. Medlock and Dr. Craven

238
00:22:01,079 --> 00:22:05,840
looked at each other in a troubled way, but there was evidently nothing to be

239
00:22:05,840 --> 00:22:14,040
done. "He does look rather better, sir," ventured Mrs. Medlock. "But"— "—thinking the matter

