257
00:23:44,639 --> 00:23:49,559
Colin, as the nurse brought in the tea and put it on the table by the sofa. "Now,

258
00:23:49,559 --> 00:23:56,119
if you'll eat I will. Those muffins look so nice and hot. Tell me about

